# Anime Metadata API — data directory

This directory holds the downloaded Fribb mapping JSON files.
They are downloaded at startup (first run) and refreshed weekly.

Do NOT commit these files — they're downloaded at runtime.

Files:
- anilist_index.json  (1.3 MB — AniList ID → position lookup)
- anime-list-mini.json (5.9 MB — full mapping data)

